    },
    "All AI features are available with Claude Opus. There are daily and monthly usage limits, twice those of Pro." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Claude Opus で AI の機能がすべて使えます。1 日と 1 か月の利用量に上限があり、Pro の 2 倍です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All AI features are available with Claude Sonnet. There are daily and monthly usage limits. If you reach them often, Max offers twice the usage." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Claude Sonnet で AI の機能がすべて使えます。1 日と 1 か月の利用量に上限があります。よく当たるなら、Max で 2 倍使えます。"
