    "Blends raw data (life principles and direction) with journals (your own records), in date order, and the AI writes out your patterns and the path to head toward. Originals are never rewritten." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "生データ（人生の指針・方向性）とジャーナル（自分の記録）を日付順に調合して、自分の傾向と向かうべき道を AI が書き出します。原本は書き換えません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Blends your raw data (life principles and direction) with your journals, and writes out your patterns and the path to head toward" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "生データ（人生の指針・方向性）とジャーナルを調合して、自分の傾向と向かうべき道を書き出します"
