    "Raw data and journals are the ingredients; your patterns are blended from them. Originals are never rewritten, so nothing is lost even if you change the PARA category later." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "生データとジャーナルを材料に、自分の傾向を調合します。原本は書き換えないので、後から PARA の所属を変えても情報は失われません。"
