    "Reading directories…" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ディレクトリを読み込み中…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reads the journals and originals from the last %lld days and sums them up under four headings: \"What kept coming up\", \"What moved forward\", \"What's stuck\", and \"Next steps\". The original notes are never rewritten." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "直近 %lld 日のジャーナルと原本を読み、「繰り返し出てきたこと」「進んだこと」「止まっていること」「次の一手」の4 つにまとめます。元の記録は書き換えません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reads your existing directories (%lld) first, then sorts each memo by whether it fits one of them. A new folder is created only when a memo fits nowhere." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "既存のディレクトリ（%lld 件）を先に読み込んでから、そこに収まるかどうかで振り分けます。新しいフォルダを作るのは、どこにも収まらないときだけです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reads your existing directory structure and sorts memos into places they fit. You review the suggestions before anything moves." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "既存のディレクトリ構造を読み込んで、そこに収まるものを振り分けます。提案を確認してから移動するので、勝手には動きません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
