    "What You Get with Pro" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pro でできること"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you talk about in Chat appears here by date." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Chat 画面で話したことが、ここに日付ごとに並びます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you use AI features (chat, journal extraction, sorting, reviews, lesson generation, and setup suggestions), the text involved (what you write, the target memos, and folder names) is sent to Anthropic's Claude API. With a subscription or the free tier, it goes through our relay server, which does not store the content. Anthropic does not use data sent through the API to train its models." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI の機能（チャット・ジャーナル抽出・分類・振り返り・教訓の生成・初期設定の提案）を使うと、そのとき扱う文章（あなたの発言、対象のメモ、フォルダ名）が Anthropic 社の Claude API に送られます。契約中・無料枠の場合は当社の中継サーバを経由しますが、中継サーバは本文を保存しません。Anthropic は API 経由のデータをモデルの学習に使いません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where should I save this?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "どのフォルダに保存しますか？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While this is off, nothing is sent from any screen. Journaling, the calendar, folders, and export keep working. You can change this in Settings at any time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "オフのあいだは、どの画面からも外部に送信しません。記録・カレンダー・フォルダ・書き出しはそのまま使えます。いつでも設定から変更できます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Will be created in /%@/%@/%@/" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "/%1$@/%2$@/%3$@/ に新規作成"
