    "Write journals yourself in the Journal tab, and look back in Calendar and Folders. All of this stays free." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Journal タブで自分でジャーナルを書き、Calendar と Folders で振り返れます。ここまではずっと無料です。"
